msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫H-⟪k:2⟫Hey... ⟪k:3⟫What ⟪k:4⟫was⟪k:5⟫ that...?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I swear I saw some kind of "
"black cloud or something..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저, ⟪k:2⟫저기……, ⟪k:3⟫방금 그거 뭐였어……?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫아주 ⟪k:6⟫잠깐 ⟪k:7⟫까만 게 번지던"
"데……."

